INSERT INTO exam_platform.scoring_results VALUES ('3b153333-06eb-4bcd-9683-eec58ab1bc4a', '3d6846c3-594b-461b-aabf-e20f7c220c02', 'llm', 1.5, '{"method": "llm_ielts_writing", "confidence": 1.0, "task_response": 1.0, "evidence_quotes": ["My name is fakhriddin", ""], "lexical_resource": 1.0, "coherence_cohesion": 1.0, "grammatical_range_accuracy": 2.0}', 'Sizning javobingiz topshiriqqa umuman aloqador emas. Sizdan jadvaldagi ma''lumotlarni umumlashtirish so''ralgan edi, lekin siz faqat o''z ismingizni yozgansiz. Imtihon talablariga ko''ra, berilgan mavzu bo''yicha kamida 150 so''zdan iborat matn yozishingiz kerak. Keyingi safar topshiriqni diqqat bilan o''qib chiqing va unda so''ralgan narsalarga javob berishga harakat qiling. Javobingizda kirish, asosiy qism va xulosa bo''lishi, shuningdek, jadvaldagi asosiy ma''lumotlar va taqqoslashlar keltirilishi lozim. Hozirgi javobingiz topshiriqning hech bir mezoniga javob bermaydi.', 'Your response is completely unrelated to the task. You were asked to summarize the information in a chart, but you only wrote a single sentence introducing yourself. To receive a score, you must address the prompt directly. For this task, you needed to write at least 150 words describing the main trends in the chart and making relevant comparisons. Your answer should have an introduction, one or two body paragraphs detailing the key features, and a concluding summary. This response does not attempt the task, so it cannot be assessed against the criteria.', '2026-05-03 18:54:05.51177+00');
